change_type: instructions+docs+code   changelog: - Added support for providing emostate_tick.js input via --payload-file and --payload-json arguments (stdin still supported, but now optional). - Documented and recommend using --payload-file for agent/cron reliability in emostate_tick.js. - Improved error handling: emostate_tick.js strictly rejects semantically empty input from both file and stdin. - Updated documentation in SKILL.md and usage in README.md to reflect new payload handling options. - Minor internal script refactoring and clarific

